namespace UObjectToolTips

DreamWorldWidgetActor {
    at    Source/DreamGUI/Public/Core/DreamWorldWidgetActor.h#DreamWorldWidgetActor
    src   "An actor that is nothing but a world-space DreamUI hierarchy: what dragging a hierarchy class into\na level produces.\n\nC++ rather than a Blueprint in the plugin's content, which is what this replaces. A root asset\ncould not be changed without re-saving content every project had already placed, there was one per\nrenderer -- so switching renderer meant swapping the actor's class -- and the component it carried\nwas reachable only through that asset."
    text  "一个仅由世界空间DreamUI层级结构构成的Actor：将层级类拖入\n关卡后生成的就是它。\n\n插件内容中使用的是C++类而非蓝图，而蓝图正是它所替换的。根资产\n若不重新保存每个项目已放置的内容就无法更改；每个\n渲染器各有一个——因此切换渲染器就意味着更换该Actor的类——而且它携带的\n组件只能通过该资产访问。"
    state machine
}

